    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The bullet bores through your thigh, creating a gory wound canal just laterally of the femur, lodging underneath the skin at the back of your leg.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Pass an <strong>Average (+20) Endurance</strong> Test or go @Condition[Prone]. Gain @Condition[Bleeding] (2) and suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.nF5z1OEhpi4t6a6S]{Torn Muscle (Minor)}.</p><p><strong>Surgery (Easy)</strong> is required for Extraction.</p>"
